{% doc %}
  Every JOY Mobile location in Eilat as a schema.org store (snippets/branch-json.liquid),
  printed as comma-separated JSON objects for the `department` list of the Organization on
  the home page (snippets/structured-data, type 'organization'). A search engine or an AI
  assistant that reads only the home page still learns every branch, its address, phone
  and opening hours.

  The home page can't read the blocks of another template, so the facts are written here
  once more: they are the branch blocks of templates/page.branches.json (the visible
  branches page, which prints the same nodes from sections/branches.liquid), with the same
  ids. When a branch, its address or its hours change, change both files. Source of the
  facts: the live site's branches page (the contact page shows the same five). Only the
  lab's coordinates are known.

  @example
  "department": [{% render 'branches-json' %}]
{% enddoc %}
{%- liquid
  assign bl_page_url = ''
  if settings.branches_page != blank
    assign bl_page_url = request.origin | append: settings.branches_page.url
  endif
-%}
